{"title": "Collagen Powder vs Liquid vs Capsules: Which Is Best?\n | INGENIOUS", "bodyClass": "template-article template- page-width-wide card-hover-effect-none product- page- ", "html": "<main\n      id=\"MainContent\"\n      class=\"content-for-layout\"\n      role=\"main\"\n      data-page-transition-enabled=\"true\"\n      data-product-transition=\"true\"\n      data-template=\"article\"\n    >\n      <div id=\"shopify-section-template--27390868062544__section\" class=\"shopify-section section-wrapper\">\n<link href=\"/assets/0fb4d5e1-blog-details-page-section.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"all\" />\n<div class=\"section-background color-scheme-1\"></div>\n<div class=\"section color-scheme-1 blog-details-page-section\">\n  <div\n    class=\"\n      spacing-style\n      layout-panel-flex\n      layout-panel-flex--column\n      section-content-wrapper\n      mobile-column\n    \"\n    style=\"\n      --flex-direction: column; --flex-wrap: nowrap;\n\n--gap: 0px;\n\n--horizontal-alignment: ; --vertical-alignment: ;\n--vertical-alignment-mobile: ;\n\n      --padding-block-start: 0px;--padding-block-end: max(20px, calc(var(--spacing-scale) * 70px));\n    \"\n  >\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  <div\n    class=\"\n  image-block image-block--AOHp2RCtuMWJ3YXRpZ__blog-post-image image-block--height-fit spacing-style size-style\n blog_featured_image\"\n    style=\"\n  --ratio: 2.0;\n  --size-style-width: 100%;--size-style-height: fit;--size-style-width-mobile: 100%; --size-style-width-mobile-min: 5rem;\n  --padding-block-start: 0px;--padding-block-end: max(20px, calc(var(--spacing-scale) * 70px));--padding-inline-start: 0px;--padding-inline-end: 0px;\n\"\n    \n  >\n    \n<img src=\"/assets/bc76626f-xconvert.com-3_e4395b16-8c1e-407d-a498-6982ee97c909.jpg\" alt=\"Collagen Powder, Liquids or Capsules: Which One Is Best?\" width=\"800\" height=\"400\" class=\"image-block__image border-style\" style=\"\n  --ratio: 2.0;\n  --border-width: 1px; --border-style: none; --border-color: rgba(from\nvar(--color-border) r g b / 1.0); --border-radius:\n0px; \n\n\">\n\n  </div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    <header>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  <div \n  class=\" spacing-style text-block text-block--AU0U1T2x5aWhpaGVLO__blog-post-title h2\n    text-block--align-left\n  \"\n\n  style=\"\n    --padding-block-start: 0px; --padding-block-end:0px; \n--padding-inline-start:0px; --padding-inline-end:0px; \n\n    \n\n    --width: 100%;\n    --max-width: var(--max-width--body-normal);\n    \n      --text-align: left;\n    \n    \n  \"\n\n  \n>\n    <h1>Collagen Powder, Liquids or Capsules: Which One Is Best?</h1>\n  </div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    </header><div id=\"shopify-block-ATi9ob3VrbUREb1ZlN__blog-post-content\" class=\"shopify-block\">\n\n<div class=\"blog-post-content rte\">\n  <rte-formatter>\n    <p> </p>\n<p>Collagen is essential for skin and overall wellness, but not all supplements are equal. Learn how to choose the right one for you with science-backed insights.</p>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Understanding Collagen: More Than Just a Trend</h2>\n<p>Collagen is a fundamental protein in the human body, making up 30% of total protein and 75% of skin. As we age, collagen production naturally declines, impacting skin, joints, and overall well-being. Choosing the right supplement is crucial to ensuring you get real benefits rather than marketing hype.</p>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Not All Clinical Trials Are Equal</h2>\n<p>Many wellness and skincare products claim to be “<a href=\"https://ingeniouslife.com/clinical-trial/\" title=\"\">clinically proven</a>,” but not all clinical trials are created equal. At Ingenious, we use the best clinical testing organisations in the UK. Our results are statistically significant and withstand the most rigorous scrutiny. Some companies use testing facilities that predetermine outcomes or avoid UK regulatory oversight.</p>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Liquids vs. Capsules: The Science Behind Stability</h2>\n<p>There’s a common belief that liquid collagen is superior, but this is not supported by science. Liquids are inherently unstable and require preservatives, flavouring agents, and other unnecessary additives. These ingredients serve manufacturing needs rather than benefiting your health.</p>\n<p>Beyond ingredient purity, liquid collagen lacks consistent absorption. The stomach’s digestive processes, including hydrochloric acid and enzymes, break down proteins into amino acids. With liquid formulations, you need to consume over 5 grams of peptides and hope some will be absorbed intact. This process is unpredictable, meaning results can vary significantly.</p>\n<p>In contrast, Ingenious <a href=\"https://ingeniouslife.com/collagen-plus/\" title=\"\">hydrolysed marine collagen capsules</a> are designed for precise, repeatable absorption. Our patented capsule technology ensures collagen peptides and other active ingredients reach the small intestine intact, where they can be absorbed efficiently. This controlled delivery system results in consistent and measurable benefits—something liquid formulations cannot guarantee.</p>\n<style>.elementor-146578 .elementor-element.elementor-element-18ada30d{--display:flex;--flex-direction:row;--container-widget-width:initial;--container-widget-height:100%;--container-widget-flex-grow:1;--container-widget-align-self:stretch;--flex-wrap-mobile:wrap;--gap:0px 0px;--row-gap:0px;--column-gap:0px;--padding-top:0px;--padding-bottom:0px;--padding-left:0px;--padding-right:0px;}.elementor-146578 .elementor-element.elementor-element-71194535{--display:flex;--flex-direction:row;--container-widget-width:calc( ( 1 - var( --container-widget-flex-grow ) ) * 100% );--container-widget-height:100%;--container-widget-flex-grow:1;--container-widget-align-self:stretch;--flex-wrap-mobile:wrap;--align-items:center;--gap:0px 0px;--row-gap:0px;--column-gap:0px;}.elementor-146578 .elementor-element.elementor-element-71194535:not(.elementor-motion-effects-element-