a-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><br></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4d43cf4a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"4d43cf4a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings='{\"background_background\":\"classic\"}'>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6ec351c7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"6ec351c7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Collagen+</h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3ed95c4a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3ed95c4a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p>The first clinically proven collagen supplement aimed at rejuvenating skin, hair and nails.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4d79dbc3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"4d79dbc3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\"><a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"https://ingeniouslife.com/collagen-plus/\"> <span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\"> <span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Buy Collagen+</span> </span> </a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Powders: Convenience vs. Effectiveness</h2>\n<p>Unflavoured collagen powders are a better alternative to liquids in terms of ingredient purity, but they come with their own challenges. Collagen peptides have a strong taste, so most powders include artificial flavours and sweeteners to mask it. Some products marketed as “creamers” for hot drinks contain additional processed ingredients that provide no health benefits.</p>\n<p>Additionally, adding collagen powders to hot drinks is problematic. Heat denatures proteins, potentially reducing their effectiveness. Even if a brand claims their peptides are stable, the reality is that heat can alter their structure. Ingenious capsules, however, remain intact even when consumed with a hot beverage, ensuring the collagen peptides reach the site of absorption without compromise.</p>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">More Than Just Collagen</h2>\n<p>Many brands offer collagen peptides alone, but true skin and wellness support requires more. Ingenious Collagen+ includes additional scientifically-backed ingredients:</p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>\n<strong>Hyaluronic Acid Complex</strong>: Our formulation is 20% more effective than the industry standard, enhancing hydration and skin plumpness.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Natural Astaxanthin</strong>: A powerful antioxidant that protects against oxidative stress and supports cellular health.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The Importance of Molecular Size</h2>\n<p>Smaller collagen peptides are more easily absorbed. Ingenious uses peptides of 2000 Daltons or less, the optimal size for maximum bioavailability. Many other brands use larger molecules that are less efficiently absorbed, meaning you may not get the full benefit of their products.</p>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Choosing the Best Collagen Supplement</h2>\n<p>When selecting a collagen supplement, look beyond marketing claims. Consider ingredient purity, absorption consistency, scientific backing, and sustainability.</p>\n<p>Ready to experience the benefits? Discover Ingenious Collagen+ today.</p>\n<style>.elementor-146578 .elementor-element.elementor-element-18ada30d{--display:flex;--flex-direction:row;--container-widget-width:initial;--container-widget-height:100%;--container-widget-flex-grow:1;--container-widget-align-self:stretch;--flex-wrap-mobile:wrap;--gap:0px 0px;--row-gap:0px;--column-gap:0px;--padding-top:0px;--padding